716
00:56:12.543 --> 00:56:17.422
Splitting a task into subtasks and merging the results of the subtasks back into one

717
00:56:17.422 --> 00:56:21.952
final result requires some communication between processes. This communication

718
00:56:21.952 --> 00:56:26.830
