1190
01:33:07.588 --> 01:33:12.781
Pandas is the data frame. Data frames are two-dimensional data structures. This

1191
01:33:12.781 --> 01:33:18.302
means they have columns, typically labeled with variable names, and rows, which also

1192
01:33:18.302 --> 01:33:23.692
have labels, known as an index in Pandas. The default index is the row number, but

1193
01:33:23.692 --> 01:33:26.190
