1266
01:39:38.880 --> 01:39:44.116
reducing the wrangling needed later on. When importing data, pandas infers each

1267
01:39:44.116 --> 01:39:49.616
column's data type. Sometimes, it guesses wrong. Checking the data types in the tax

1268
01:39:49.616 --> 01:39:55.117
data, we see that pandas interpreted zip codes as integers. They're more accurately

