1271
01:40:03.600 --> 01:40:08.955
We can set the data type of any or all columns with ReadCSV's dtype keyword

1272
01:40:08.955 --> 01:40:14.881
argument. dtype takes a dictionary, where each key is a column name, and each value

1273
01:40:14.881 --> 01:40:20.522
is the data type that column should be. Note that non-standard data types, like

1274
01:40:20.522 --> 01:40:26.448
pandas categories, must be passed in quotations. Here, we specify that the zip code

1275
01:40:26.448 --> 01:40:31.660
