02:52:29.543 --> 02:52:35.264
each Pokemon. It also has the generation of each Pokemon specifying what version of

2104
02:52:35.264 --> 02:52:40.779
the game the Pokemon appears in. Here, Squirtle, a Pokemon from Generation 1, is

2105
02:52:40.779 --> 02:52:46.432
shown. The metadata also includes the Pokemon's type and whether or not it belongs

