02:53:14.980 --> 02:53:20.262
We can iterate over the names list using enumerate and grab each Pokemon's

2114
02:53:20.262 --> 02:53:26.257
corresponding health points using the index variable. But Python's built-in function

2115
02:53:26.257 --> 02:53:31.825
zip provides a more elegant solution. The name zip describes how this function

2116
02:53:31.825 --> 02:53:37.678
