2117
02:53:37.678 --> 02:53:43.459
Zip returns a zip object that must be unpacked into a list and printed to see the

2118
02:53:43.459 --> 02:53:44.030
content.

2119
02:53:44.030 --> 02:53:50.201
Each item is a tuple of elements from the original list. Python comes with a number

