05:44:11.957 --> 05:44:16.468
session. As long as you are inside the session, you can only write Python. For

4262
05:44:16.468 --> 05:44:21.037
example, we can type, print open parentheses, quotation marks, hello world, end

4263
05:44:21.037 --> 05:44:25.605
quotation marks, end parentheses, which is Python. The terminal will echo back,

