6245
08:05:47.280 --> 08:05:52.070
Many modern organizations are becoming aware of just how valuable the data they

6246
08:05:52.070 --> 08:05:56.920
collected is. Internally, the data is becoming more and more democratized. It is

6247
08:05:56.920 --> 08:06:01.952
being made accessible to almost anyone within the company, so that new insights can

6248
08:06:01.952 --> 08:06:06.863
be generated. Also, on the public-facing side, companies are making more and more

6249
08:06:06.863 --> 08:06:11.774
data available to people in the form of, for example, public APIs. The genesis of

6250
08:06:11.774 --> 08:06:14.260
the data is with the operational systems.

6251
08:06:14.260 --> 08:06:18.993
Such as streaming data collected from various Internet of Things devices, or web

6252
08:06:18.993 --> 08:06:23.608
session data from Google Analytics or some sales platform. This data has to be

6253
08:06:23.608 --> 08:06:28.518
stored somewhere so that it can be processed at later times. Nowadays, the scale of

6254
08:06:28.518 --> 08:06:33.487
the data and velocity at which it flows has led to the rise of what we call the data

6255
08:06:33.487 --> 08:06:38.398
lake. The data lake comprises several systems and is typically organized in several

6256
08:06:38.398 --> 08:06:42.480
zones. The data that comes from the operational systems, for example,

6257
08:06:42.480 --> 08:06:47.812
ends up in what we call the landing zone. This zone forms the basis of truth. It is

6258
08:06:47.812 --> 08:06:52.758
always there and is the unaltered version of the data as it was received. The

6259
08:06:52.758 --> 08:06:58.154
process of getting data into the data lake is called ingestion. People build various

6260
08:06:58.154 --> 08:07:02.908
kinds of services on top of this data lake, like predictive algorithms and

6261
08:07:02.908 --> 08:07:08.111
dashboards for A-B tests of marketing teams. Many of these services apply similar

6262
08:07:08.111 --> 08:07:09.910
