6263
08:07:09.960 --> 08:07:14.709
To prevent duplication of common transformations, data from the landing zone gets

6264
08:07:14.709 --> 08:07:19.106
cleaned and stored in the clean zone. We'll see in the next chapter what is

6265
08:07:19.106 --> 08:07:23.914
typically meant by clean data. Finally, per use case, some special transformations

6266
08:07:23.914 --> 08:07:28.721
are applied to this clean data. For example, predicting which customers are likely

6267
08:07:28.721 --> 08:07:33.646
to churn is a common business use case. You would apply a machine learning algorithm

6268
08:07:33.646 --> 08:07:36.460
to a dataset composed of several clean datasets.

6269
08:07:36.460 --> 08:07:41.407
This domain-specific data is stored in the business layer. To move data from one

6270
08:07:41.407 --> 08:07:46.354
