6271
08:07:46.354 --> 08:07:51.425
word comes from the similarity of how liquids and gases flow through pipelines. In

6272
08:07:51.425 --> 08:07:56.373
this case, it's just data that flows. The pipelines can be triggered by external

6273
08:07:56.373 --> 08:08:01.443
events, like files being stored in a certain location, on a time schedule, or even

6274
08:08:01.443 --> 08:08:02.000
manually.

6275
08:08:02.000 --> 08:08:06.934
Usually, the pipelines that handle data in large batches are triggered on a

6276
08:08:06.934 --> 08:08:12.065
schedule, like overnight. We call these pipelines extract, transform, and load

6277
08:08:12.065 --> 08:08:17.460
pipelines, or ETL pipelines in short. There are typically many pipelines existing.

6278
08:08:17.460 --> 08:08:22.986
To keep a good oversight, these are triggered by tools that provide many benefits to

6279
