08:23:12.045 --> 08:23:14.220
simply represented by the null value.

6472
08:23:14.220 --> 08:23:19.446
Many libraries have built-in functionality to deal with this appropriately. Here, we

6473
08:23:19.446 --> 08:23:24.423
replace the values that are illogical by using a condition in the when function.

