08:23:24.423 --> 08:23:29.587
When the condition is met, we replace the values with Python's none, which in Spark

6475
08:23:29.587 --> 08:23:34.813
gets translated to none. Otherwise, we leave the column unaltered. Alright, now that

6476
08:23:34.813 --> 08:23:39.728
we saw how we can clean our untidy data, let's... Congratulations on completing

6477
08:23:39.728 --> 08:23:41.470
those exercises on cleaning.

6478
08:23:41.470 --> 08:23:46.229
Now let's look at some functions that help generate insights. Insights are typically

6479
08:23:46.229 --> 08:23:50.931
derived after data has been massaged somewhat. Cleaning helps with that. An example

6480
08:23:50.931 --> 08:23:55.520
of an insight is knowing the top 10 best-rated hotels in your neighborhood, which

