6720
08:41:42.510 --> 08:41:47.247
In this case, we instruct CircleCI to check out the code from the code repository,

6721
08:41:47.247 --> 08:41:51.926
to install the modules we require, and to run the test suite with PyTest. If your

6722
08:41:51.926 --> 08:41:56.663
