could trigger this way. One advantage of running these commands through Airflow is

6780
08:46:29.503 --> 08:46:34.694
that the runs are logged, monitored and possibly retried. Any Airflow operator takes

6781
08:46:34.694 --> 08:46:39.020
a TaskID, which is a unique identifier that can be chosen by the user.

6782
08:46:39.020 --> 08:46:43.947
A reference to the DAG object, to which we assign this task, is also common among

6783
08:46:43.947 --> 08:46:48.752
