09:39:40.217 --> 09:39:45.736
looked up recognition in available services in Bato docs. I found the parameter to

7377
09:39:45.736 --> 09:39:51.254
pass to create the client. Then, I was able to see the available operations. Let's

7378
09:39:51.254 --> 09:39:56.706
explore them. Let's see how we can use recognition for object detection. The city

