7396
09:41:29.890 --> 09:41:35.738
We learned how to detect objects in an image and count instances of them. We talked

7397
09:41:35.738 --> 09:41:41.304
about how to approach learning a new AWS service with Bato. We looked at how to

7398
09:41:41.304 --> 09:41:47.151
recognize text in an image and tell the difference between word and line detection.

7399
09:41:47.151 --> 09:41:52.999
We also explored when to build our own or use a service like recognition, but we'll

7400
09:41:52.999 --> 09:41:58.424
only learn so much in slides. Let's go! In the last lesson, we used the Bato3

7401
09:41:58.424 --> 09:41:59.340
documentation

7402
09:41:59.340 --> 09:42:04.518
and the AWS console to explore a new service, recognition. Oftentimes, data

