09:42:04.518 --> 09:42:10.179
engineering requires working with unstructured text data, customer comments, other

7404
09:42:10.179 --> 09:42:15.840
fields, tweets, or posts. A huge component of data engineering is in reaching data

7405
09:42:15.840 --> 09:42:21.363
with values that will be needed for analysis downstream. In this lesson, we will

7406
09:42:21.363 --> 09:42:26.817
look at two services that let us work with free text data without being natural

7407
09:42:26.817 --> 09:42:28.750
language processing experts.

7408
09:42:28.750 --> 09:42:34.618
AWS Translate and AWS Comprehend. Let's dig in. Because we know now the basics of

7409
09:42:34.618 --> 09:42:40.559
working with AWS, learning additional services is pretty straightforward. We start

7410
09:42:40.559 --> 09:42:46.572
with finding the AWS Translate service in the console and playing with it. Next, we

