09:42:52.512 --> 09:42:55.410
this work for us, Translate Text. First,

7413
09:42:55.410 --> 09:43:00.797
Let's initialize the BATO3 client for AWS Translate. No surprises here, just a

7414
09:43:00.797 --> 09:43:06.322
regular client initialization with the service name of Translate as an argument.

7415
09:43:06.322 --> 09:43:11.985
Then we call the Translate text. We pass the text we want to translate in the text

7416
09:43:11.985 --> 09:43:17.579
argument. We let Amazon detect the source language on its own by passing auto for

