09:45:38.005 --> 09:45:43.514
source language by using AWS Comprehend in the background. We can do that too by

7446
09:45:43.514 --> 09:45:44.340
initializing

7447
09:45:44.340 --> 09:45:50.477
the AWS Comprehend Pato 3 client. Then we call the detect dominant language method

