09:45:50.477 --> 09:45:56.240
to figure out what language a chunk of text is. We can also use AWS to detect

7449
09:45:56.240 --> 09:46:02.452
sentiment using Comprehend's detect sentiment method. Now that we have some serious

7450
09:46:02.452 --> 09:46:08.739
NLP in our pocket, we're here, the last lesson of the last chapter. In the past four

7451
09:46:08.739 --> 09:46:12.780
chapters, we learned how to use cloud storage with S3,

