09:46:12.780 --> 09:46:18.377
notifications with SNS, image recognition with recognition, text translation with

7453
09:46:18.377 --> 09:46:24.113
translate, and NLP with comprehend. Let's put these skills together to a real-world

7454
09:46:24.113 --> 09:46:29.434
use case. In the past year, the city has seen an onslaught of scooters on its

