7479
09:48:20.577 --> 09:48:25.876
First, Sam needs to initialize all the Bato3 service clients. We start with the

7480
09:48:25.876 --> 09:48:31.310
Recognition client and Comprehend client, followed by the Translate client. Next,

7481
09:48:31.310 --> 09:48:36.911
We translate all the public descriptions to English to make sure we're working in

7482
09:48:36.911 --> 09:48:42.511
