10:26:19.915 --> 10:26:25.131
one of the most important concepts in database systems, referential integrity. It's

7955
10:26:25.131 --> 10:26:29.971
a very simple concept that states that a record referencing another record in

7956
10:26:29.971 --> 10:26:34.370
another table must always refer to an existing record. In other words,

