use this query. It excludes views from PG Catalog and Information Schema, which are

8352
10:54:45.221 --> 10:54:49.684
built-in view categories. Can you see why views are useful? First off, a view

8353
10:54:49.684 --> 10:54:54.495
doesn't take up any storage except for the query statement, which is minimal. Views

8354
10:54:54.495 --> 10:54:56.350
