8355
10:54:56.350 --> 10:55:00.775
For example, instead of giving a user access to columns that may have sensitive

8356
10:55:00.775 --> 10:55:05.312
information, you can restrict what they see via a view. Perhaps most importantly,

8357
10:55:05.312 --> 10:55:10.018
views mask the complexity of queries. Remember those snowflake schemas from the last

8358
10:55:10.018 --> 10:55:14.723
chapter and their joins? Views are handy for views normalized past 2nf. You can make

8359
10:55:14.723 --> 10:55:19.260
those common joins, such as aggregating dates or genres, into views. The users of

8360
10:55:19.260 --> 10:55:23.965
your database will thank you for views because they won't have to spend as much time

8361
10:55:23.965 --> 10:55:25.870
