Analysis calculations are the process of using the columns of data in a data frame

10562
13:44:37.506 --> 13:44:41.557
to compute some useful value using Spark's functionality. We've used UDFs in

10563
13:44:41.557 --> 13:44:45.874
previous chapters, and this version illustrates calculating an average sale price

10564
