13:46:51.917 --> 13:46:55.703
different datasets as you can find. Different types of data require different

10597
13:46:55.703 --> 13:46:59.537
techniques in Spark, and each has challenges when trying to process data in an

10598
13:46:59.537 --> 13:47:03.519
efficient way. The datasets available within the various courses here on DataCamp

