14:02:53.440 --> 14:02:59.864
occurred 49 times. The three-tuple I think that is second most frequent at 46

10797
14:02:59.864 --> 14:03:06.537
occurrences. We are not limited to counting. We can look at other aspects of the

10798
14:03:06.537 --> 14:03:11.960
word sequences. This query finds the longest three-tuples. Again.

