11223
14:40:17.360 --> 14:40:22.779
If we want every value from the name column to be without these X spaces, we will

11224
14:40:22.779 --> 14:40:27.998
have to include it within the previous functions. Let's see another example of

11225
14:40:27.998 --> 14:40:33.551
message strings. If we analyze the content of the airport table, we can see that in

11226
14:40:33.551 --> 14:40:39.105
the airport state column, we have different values for the state of Florida. All of

