14:40:45.260 --> 14:40:51.008
Let's see how to unify these different strings. If we decide to unify all these

11230
14:40:51.008 --> 14:40:57.047
different strings to Florida, we can use the replace function. Replace replaces all

11231
14:40:57.047 --> 14:41:02.358
occurrences of a specified string with another string. The replacement is

11232
